4.1 Network Switch

A network switch connects devices within a LAN and forwards Ethernet frames based primarily on MAC addresses.

Concept
PC1 ──┐
PC2 ──┼── Switch
PC3 ──┘
Interview Answer

A network switch connects devices on a local network and forwards Ethernet frames based primarily on MAC addresses.

